  "interpretation": [
    "Both backings returned to the same occupied size after each of three cycles with the same live namespace size.",
    "The packed backing retained no physically releasable suffix. The sparse backing reused its logical ranges with larger EOF and unchanged occupied size.",
    "Every cycle included a newly started helper, a retained reader and a detached independent CPU audit. Backing and inode retirement were no longer actionable after each detach.",
    "This selected client shape supports larger sustained attachment and interruption qualification. It does not measure throughput or real persistent-media failure behavior."
  ]
